{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Wishlist/Follow and then Join our Discord and the Army of Luminaries</i> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/e18700d8fac39474ebc30b991fbddb8f.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/e18700d8fac39474ebc30b991fbddb8f.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/e18700d8fac39474ebc30b991fbddb8f.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>MAIN FEATURES of LUMINARY</strong><br>With overall graphical fidelity, and ease of playability for the Openworld Action RPG genre for everyone, There are 5 main pillars of Luminary, that the gameplay and mechanics focus on: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION AND ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - A dense hand crafted world to explore, with a robust fun locomotion system that allows you to go anywhere.<br><br>Climb the tallest mountains, brave the deepest waters, glide to distant lands, with many hidden treasure to uncover  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/0522cb9b66f0f3be71dc667139d31620.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/0522cb9b66f0f3be71dc667139d31620.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/0522cb9b66f0f3be71dc667139d31620.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLES AND COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - A real time skill based combat system, where you can switch between fighting styles at the press of a button.<br><br> Melee, Ranged, Magic, Blocking, Dodging, Enjoy! and swap to different weapons during fights to keep it dynamic  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/472c553b07a01defd15c4b11716b2261.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/472c553b07a01defd15c4b11716b2261.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/472c553b07a01defd15c4b11716b2261.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EASY CO-OP MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Drop in Drop out, 3 players online, with a planned 2 player local couch co-op option. No Hassle and No Problems.<br><br> The Character you\u2019ve been progressing in your Solo game, is the same one you will use and progress further if you join another friends game. Your character save is NOT stuck and tied to a world save.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/82ff6277eabe8f4a0ce63aabee0e0ff8.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/82ff6277eabe8f4a0ce63aabee0e0ff8.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/82ff6277eabe8f4a0ce63aabee0e0ff8.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTINUED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Not only does your character progress in stats through gameplay, but EVERYTHING you use in the game progresses. <br><br>Use Health Potions a lot? Now Health Potions cure more HP when Consumed. Leveling weapons unlocks new skills. You will also level up your town shops through trading resources, which will unlock more weapon and armor upgrades. <br><br>- Your progression stays with you, from solo, to co-op and back through multiple playthroughs. And even your town upgrades go with you into New Game +. You will Unlock new Tier levels of difficulty every time you beat the maps end boss, and those higher Tiers are where the enemies are tougher but the rewards and XP are even greater.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fd804cf1bce77a8ae8760f871d23a9be.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fd804cf1bce77a8ae8760f871d23a9be.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/fd804cf1bce77a8ae8760f871d23a9be.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And last but not least, ROLE PLAYING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Not everything in Luminary is tied to combat. There will be mining, fishing, animal catching, and other things to enjoy. And in Multiplayer you are not tied to your Host\u2019s location, you are free to play your way, even in their game.<br><br>You can be the team\u2019s miner, searching for the best ores, and trade them to your friends for their precious GOLD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/a55d70675a5e8b99c7a92f8ddb0434eb.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/a55d70675a5e8b99c7a92f8ddb0434eb.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/a55d70675a5e8b99c7a92f8ddb0434eb.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, a primal magic surged from the earth's depths, fueling empires but twisting it's inhabitant and the world into corruption's grasp. Forests blackened, skies bled shadow, and rivers turned to poison.<br><br>But a less prevalent radiant energy was also born, and hidden within pure warriors, the Luminaries. Armed with the light, their goal is to reclaim the land, hurling back the blight.<br><br>Yet the Luminary's gift is double-edged,  immortality that tempts the soul. Every 80 years, Luminaries must yield their light to a successor, or risk eternal decay. Defiant ones hoard it, swelling into godlike tyrants of darkness, the Ebonarchs<br><br>As a new Luminary, rise in power. Shatter the Ebonarch's abyssal power source to strip their immortality, and strike them down. Together with your fellow Luminaries, push back the Darkness with Light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/766b2338f0a2f5898f707f24fa00524a.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1648360?t=1763233931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1648360?t=1763233931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/f2f4d0af8cffb86fba618518013da452be0b4ad6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763233931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/f2f4d0af8cffb86fba618518013da452be0b4ad6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763233931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4059020,"descripti