33931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And last but not least, ROLE PLAYING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Not everything in Luminary is tied to combat. There will be mining, fishing, animal catching, and other things to enjoy. And in Multiplayer you are not tied to your Host\u2019s location, you are free to play your way, even in their game.<br><br>You can be the team\u2019s miner, searching for the best ores, and trade them to your friends for their precious GOLD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/a55d70675a5e8b99c7a92f8ddb0434eb.poster.avif?t=1763233931\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/a55d70675a5e8b99c7a92f8ddb0434eb.webm?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1648360/extras/a55d70675a5e8b99c7a92f8ddb0434eb.mp4?t=1763233931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, a primal magic surged from the earth's depths, fueling empires but twisting it's inhabitant and the world into corruption's grasp. Forests blackened, skies bled shadow, and rivers turned to poison.<br><br>But a less prevalent radiant energy was also born, and hidden within pure warriors, the Luminaries. Armed with the light, their goal is to reclaim the land, hurling back the blight.<br><br>Yet the Luminary's gift is double-edged,  immortality that tempts the soul. Every 80 years, Luminaries must yield their light to a successor, or risk eternal decay. Defiant ones hoard it, swelling into godlike tyrants of darkness, the Ebonarchs<br><br>As a new Luminary, rise in power. Shatter the Ebonarch's abyss